  "Only past the deadline": "",
  "8 of 46 tickets match. The list updates when you apply.": "",
  "Clear": "",
  "Save as a view": "",
  "Apply": "",
  "The table starts here. Column headers sort; the subtitle in the header counts what the table shows against the whole set.": "",
  "Four ways to look at the same list": "",
  "Table.": "",
  "The default. Dense, one row per item, every column sortable, the row opens the detail page.": "",
  "Cards.": "",
  "For things with a face or a picture: residents, products, publications. Avatar or image first, two lines of text, the status pill.": "",
  "Board.": "",
  "Columns per value of one object property, the status by default; the items as cards. The same filters apply; dragging a card changes the property. A sales pipeline is the same board on the stage property.": "",
  "Map.": "",
  "Only when the objects carry an address. Pins on the map, the filtered list beside it; the switch hides the option otherwise. In this canvas the map is drawn on the dossiq case list, because cases carry addresses and reports in pipelinq become cases.": "",
  "The subtitle counts: \"Showing 8 of 46\". Never a bare total when the list shows fewer. The table footer repeats \"8 of 46\" on the left and numbered pages on the right (1 2 3, Next); there is no \"Show more\".": "",
  "Saved views are the quick way in: a view is a filter set with a name and a live count. \"Save as a view\" in the panel makes one.": "",
  "The Filter button carries the number of active filters. Open, it expands under the toolbar; it never covers the list. The search field always sits under the toolbar, with the active filter chips beside it.": "",
  "Active filters stay visible as chips with a remove button, plus Clear all. Removing a chip updates the list at once.": "",
  "Few options are checkbox chips; many options are a select; dates are two date fields. A toggle is a single checkbox.": "",
  "Download exports the list as it is shown: same view, same filters, same sort. Column choice is in the table header menu.": "",
  "Every row starts with a checkbox and ends with one \"...\" menu: no icons on hover, no text buttons in a row. The blue selection band appears above the table only while rows are selected.": "",
  "At phone width the buttons wrap under the title, the toolbar stacks, the table scrolls sideways and Cards becomes the better default.": ""
}
